{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_4A1FD7E3","title":"Tell Taylor You Spread the Word","entry":"Dlg_4A1FD7E3::entry","exit":"Dlg_4A1FD7E3::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_6C0B015F","articyId":"72057697117170034","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Taylor Hernz","text":"Ahoy! Well, if it ain't my favorite land-locked city-slicker.","speakerId":"Ntt_9C42C4AC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ahoy! Well, if it ain't my favorite land-locked city-slicker.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":175.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26749","byteOffset":17998336,"byteLength":372}},{"id":"DFr_7DBC8F8D","articyId":"72057697117170048","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Taylor Hernz","text":"'Course I'm happy. I'm hearing my name in the whisper mill. That's the first step yah know.","speakerId":"Ntt_9C42C4AC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"'Course I'm happy. I'm hearing my name in the whisper mill. That's the first step yah know.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":775.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20443","byteOffset":15616536,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_F0AD343B","articyId":"72057697117170075","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Taylor Hernz","text":"Of course. That's what the Mooring Ghosts do. They whisper and lure you toward the docks.","speakerId":"Ntt_9C42C4AC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Of course. That's what the Mooring Ghosts do. They whisper and lure you toward the docks.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1375.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31198","byteOffset":19683120,"byteLength":464}},{"id":"DFr_FD7673AC","articyId":"72057697117170095","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Taylor Hernz","text":"Notapriesty!","speakerId":"Ntt_9C42C4AC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Notapriesty!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":1375.0,"y":625.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20641","byteOffset":15693464,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_3D54B70E","articyId":"72057697117170110","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Taylor Hernz","text":"Notapriesty! You know, being known for things and what not.","speakerId":"Ntt_9C42C4AC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Notapriesty! You know, being known for things and what not.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1975.0,"y":625.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50907","byteOffset":33598448,"byteLength":404}},{"id":"DFr_E80EBA88","articyId":"72057697117170118","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Taylor Hernz","text":"Aye. Before you know it yer dangling from a pylon while bio-infused sharks take chunks from yer ass!","speakerId":"Ntt_9C42C4AC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Aye. Before you know it yer dangling from a pylon while bio-infused sharks take chunks from yer ass!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":1975.0,"y":125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44990","byteOffset":31354776,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_44022E53","articyId":"72057697117170139","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Taylor Hernz","text":"No we do not! Now go forth! Watch and see how the word spreads like wildfire. Deeds done by a fearsome Captain.","speakerId":"Ntt_9C42C4AC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No we do not! Now go forth! Watch and see how the word spreads like wildfire. Deeds done by a fearsome Captain.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2575.0,"y":125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18889","byteOffset":15033152,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_5DDE2AA2","articyId":"72057697117170152","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Taylor Hernz","text":"'Spose anything might if yer head is below the galley. You best keep yer ear to the sky though. Watch and see how the words you spoke spread like a flock of lunar moths above a calm and eerie sea.","speakerId":"Ntt_9C42C4AC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"'Spose anything might if yer head is below the galley. You best keep yer ear to the sky though. Watch and see how the words you spoke spread like a flock of lunar moths above a calm and eerie sea.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":2575.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32338","byteOffset":20116280,"byteLength":504}},{"id":"DFr_CE458E84","articyId":"72057697117170160","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Taylor Hernz","text":"Aye! And next thing you know you wake up naked and riding a weather buoy smack in the middle of a ferry route!","speakerId":"Ntt_9C42C4AC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Aye! And next thing you know you wake up naked and riding a weather buoy smack in the middle of a ferry route!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":1975.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resour